OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 206 homes on former golf
OL,4,Acourse rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have rejected plans to
OL,7,Fbuild more than 200 homes on a former
OL,8,Fgolf course after a series of votes.
OL,10,FMore than 1,000 public objections were
OL,11,Flodged to Elmbridge Borough Council
OL,12,Fagainst Charterhouse Strategic Land and
OL,13,FMoore Place Holdings' application to
OL,14,Fdevelop the disused Moore Place Golf
OL,15,FClub in Surrey.
OL,17,FThe plans could have seen 206 homes
OL,18,Fbuilt on the edge of Esher, with half
OL,19,Fof them set to be affordable, according
OL,20,Fto the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,21,FService.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
