OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 206 homes on former golf
OL,4,Acourse rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut they were kicked out after the
OL,7,Fauthority declined to designate the
OL,8,Fland as grey belt - which the
OL,9,Fgovernment previously described as
OL,10,F"poor quality and ugly areas" on parts
OL,11,Fof protected land, called the green
OL,12,Fbelt.
